sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Control Plane
    participant O as SQLite Outbox
    participant R as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Control Event Consumer
    C->>O: transactionally write event
    O-->>C: pending
    O->>R: publish
    R-->>O: publisher confirm
    O-->>O: mark sent
    R->>N: deliver
    N-->>R: manual ACK after durable handling
    R-->>R: failure → DLX → DLQ
    Note over O,R: RabbitMQ restart后，未确认 outbox 事件继续投递
